# Build-time secret for scripts/sync-github.ts. Never commit a real value.
#
# - Set it in the Vercel project's Environment Variables (Production and Preview) and, for a local
#   `pnpm sync:github`, in your shell. It is read from process.env during the build only.
# - Never prefix it with VITE_: Vite would expose such a variable to the browser bundle.
# - Least privilege: a read-only token for the portfolio owner. A fine-grained personal access token
#   with "Public repositories (read-only)" is sufficient while every pinned repository is public;
#   add "Contents: Read-only" for any private repository you choose to pin.
PORTFOLIO_GH_TOKEN=
